  "recordType": "rule-part",
  "ruleText": "PART Agr 501 WEEKLY MARKET BULLETIN PURPOSE AND DEFINITIONS\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #6039, effective 7-1-95, made extensive additions to the rules in Part Agr 501 and readopted other rules which had expired, and made some amendments. Document #6039 added sections Agr 501.11 and Agr 501.18 through Agr 501.26. Document #6039 supersedes all prior filings for the sections in this part. The prior filings for rules within former Part Agr 501 include the following documents:\n\n#1236, eff 11-1-78\n\n#1847, eff 11-1-81\n\n#2521, eff 11-1-83\n\n#2540, eff 11-21-83\n\n#4429, eff 6-1-88\n\n#4853, eff 6-28-90\n\nThe following rules now contained in Document #6039 were out of effect between June 1, 1994 and July 1, 1995:",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr500.html"
